Homepage: https://cider.sh
Description: Cider Collective apt repository (source entry and signing key)
 Installs the official Cider apt source and its signing key, using the same
 paths as Cider's own instructions, so nothing ends up configured twice.
 A valid Cider licence is still needed to use the app.
